## Session Context (Travelprep MCP)

You have access to a trip preparation MCP server with accommodation search (Airbnb, Booking.com), destination info (Wikipedia, Wikivoyage, Open-Meteo, REST Countries), and Booking.com account access.

**Before starting work:**
1. Check available operations: `stays(operation=...)`, `destination(operation=...)`, `hotel_extras(operation=...)`, `account(operation=...)` — all portmanteau tools with Literal operation enums
2. For destination info - use destination tool: `destination(operation="full", place="Paris")`

**At end of work:**
- Save any promising listings or destination references
- Note any bot-detection issues with Booking.com searches
